<fieldset class="application-step" data-application-step hidden aria-labelledby="health-step-title">
  <legend id="health-step-title">Health planning</legend>
  <p class="step-intro">
    ALV will discuss health, accessibility, dietary, and service-animal needs through an approved
    private follow-up process.
  </p>

  <div class="info-box">
    <strong>No health or crisis information is collected on this website.</strong>
    Please do not enter diagnoses, medications, treatment details, or other medical information in another
    field. ALV staff will explain how to share only the information needed to plan a safe retreat after
    reviewing your application.
  </div>

  <div class="info-box">
    This application is not monitored for emergencies. If you need immediate crisis support, call
    <a href="tel:988">988</a> and press 1 for the Veterans Crisis Line.
  </div>
</fieldset>
